  Lemma L_powi : forall (k : nat) Q m (x1 x5 x6 x7 x9 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x18 x20 x21 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x30 x31 : word) Ft fc
